TI  - Oneiris: An AI-augmented Brain-Computer Interface for Exploring Personal and Collective Dreamscapes
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE CONFERENCE ON ANIMATION AND INTERACTIVE ART, EXPANDED 2025
