TI  - Structured Reinterpretation of Buddhist Philosophy: A Systematic Interdisciplinary Review of Doctrinal Translation in Education, Psychology, and Social Practice
T2  - HUMAN ARENAS
LA  - English
KW  - Buddhist philosophy
KW  - Mindfulness
KW  - Interdisciplinary translation
