TI  - What Drives People to Share Misinformation on Social Media during the COVID-19 Pandemic: A Stimulus-Organism-Response Perspective
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH AND PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - misinformation sharing
KW  - COVID-19
KW  - social media dependency
KW  - stimulus-organism-response
KW  - FAKE NEWS
KW  - NETWORKING SITES
KW  - MASS-MEDIA
