TI  - Consumers' attitudes and their effects on electric vehicle sales and charging infrastructure construction: An empirical study in China
T2  - ENERGY POLICY
LA  - English
KW  - Charging infrastructure
KW  - New energy vehicles
KW  - Natural language processing technology
