TI  - Effect of interleukin-1 inhibition in a cohort of patients with colchicine-resistant familial Mediterranean fever treated consecutively with anakinra and canakinumab
T2  - CLINICAL AND EXPERIMENTAL RHEUMATOLOGY
LA  - English
