TI  - M3Former: Memory-Guided Multi-Modal Generation and Adaptive Mixture Reasoning for Incomplete-Modality Crisis Event Detection
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON CIRCUITS AND SYSTEMS FOR VIDEO TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
