TI  - Interactive Simulation of Disease Contagion in Dynamic Crowds
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 14TH ACM SIGGRAPH CONFERENCE ON MOTION, INTERACTION AND GAMES, MIG 2021
LA  - English
CP  - 14th Annual Conference on Motion, Interaction and Games (MIG)
KW  - disease spreading models
