TI  - Kolmogorov n-width and Lagrangian physics-informed neural networks: A causality-conforming manifold for convection-dominated PDEs
T2  - COMPUTER METHODS IN APPLIED MECHANICS AND ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Deep learning
