TI  - Artificial intelligence as toolset for analysis of public opinion and social interaction in marketing: identification of micro and nano influencers
T2  - FRONTIERS IN COMMUNICATION
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - emotion analysis
KW  - intelligent opinion analysis
